111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 42 0 R
/E (Flow Matching: Given a ground-truth action trajectory A, we construct an intermediate, noisy trajectory At At at a sampled flow time tt. We then project At At, combine it with timestep conditioning, and process it through the Action Decoder. The decoder predicts the target vector field at each action position; inference integrates this learned field to produce continuous actions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8 11 9 12 10]
>>
endobj
