/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Quantum & hybrid AI: dedicated quantum-computing/algorithm expertise with AI/Transformer architecture. VLAM & multimodal: vision, language, RAG, semantic representation and evaluation. Efficiency: algorithms, optimization, classical controls and tensor-network experimentation. Physical AI: physics-informed AI, signal processing and engineering-domain perspective. Systems & deployment: enterprise architecture, performance engineering, real-time vision and mobile/edge development. Execution fit. QEI combines the complementary skills needed to implement the canonical QVLA architecture, establish strong classical controls, conduct quantum-inspired and QPU experiments, compress the Action Decoder, and evaluate an end-to-end continuous-action VLAM. Individual claims are intentionally conservative; the execution capability is based on the combined team.)
